WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.033
Meet Dhaan Saathi, a companion for your rice. It is a free phone
app for rice farmers.

2
00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:11.133
Around the world, pests and diseases destroy about 30 percent of
the rice harvest.

3
00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:22.633
India grew a record 150 million tonnes of rice in 2024-25. Yet 86
percent of its farms are smaller than 2 hectares, so every lost
plant hurts.

4
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:26.800
And more than half of India's farm households got no technical
advice at all.

5
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.733
Dhaan Saathi brings rice photo checking to your phone. Free, and
offline.

6
00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:36.367
Choose Rice. Take a clear photo, or select one you have saved.

7
00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:40.967
Confirm your photo. The checker runs on the phone, without
internet.

8
00:00:40.967 --> 00:00:46.033
Use English or Hindi. Read on screen, or tap Hear when you want
spoken help.

9
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:50.067
Home takes you back for another photo. Close exits the app.

10
00:00:50.067 --> 00:00:54.133
We plan to add more Indian languages and support for other crops
in future.

11
00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:59.067
This experimental tool needs field testing. Help us explore its
potential.

12
00:00:59.067 --> 00:01:05.067
A project by Dr. Chindanoor Rajesh. Visit
abilityenhancerapps.com.
